{"text":"[conversational] You didn't start this business to answer a phone.\n\nYou started it to fix things. On your own terms.\n\nBut the phone rings when you're on a roof.\n\nIt rings when you're under a slide.\n\nAnd every call you miss, you chase down that night, at the kitchen table. If they haven't already called the next guy.\n\nSo stay on the roof.\n\nServiceNomad answers. It asks what you'd ask, and books the job the way you would.\n\nYour customer knows you're coming. You get paid before you pull out.\n\nAnd you're home for dinner.\n\nServiceNomad. Stay on the roof.","lines":["You didn't start this business to answer a phone.","You started it to fix things. On your own terms.","But the phone rings when you're on a roof.","It rings when you're under a slide.","And every call you miss, you chase down that night, at the kitchen table. If they haven't already called the next guy.","So stay on the roof.","ServiceNomad answers. It asks what you'd ask, and books the job the way you would.","Your customer knows you're coming. You get paid before you pull out.","And you're home for dinner.","ServiceNomad. Stay on the roof."],"voice_id":"iRc49NKOKzEg1DVxmcRs","model_id":"eleven_v4","alignment":{"characters":["[","c","o","n","v","e","r","s","a","t","i","o","n","a","l","]"," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","i","d","n","'","t"," ","s","t","a","r","t"," ","t","h","i","s"," ","b","u","s","i","n","e","s","s"," ","t","o"," ","a","n","s","w","e","r"," ","a"," ","p","h","o","n","e",".","\n","\n","Y","o","u"," ","s","t","a","r","t","e","d"," ","i","t"," ","t","o"," ","f","i","x"," ","t","h","i","n","g","s","."," ","O","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","o","w","n"," ","t","e","r","m","s",".","\n","\n","B","u","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","p","h","o","n","e"," ","r","i","n","g","s"," ","w","h","e","n"," ","y","o","u","'","r","e"," ","o","n"," ","a"," ","r","o","o","f",".","\n","\n","I","t"," ","r","i","n","g","s"," ","w","h","e","n"," ","y","o","u","'","r","e"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","a"," ","s